{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfc;--card:#fff;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#5b6cff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);--shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(16,24,40,0.08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfbfc 0%,#f6f7fb 100%);color:#0f172a;line-height:1.45}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 36px}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 12px;font-weight:600}
    nav a strong{color:var(--accent)}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto;padding:24px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .pattern{height:160px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#eef2ff;padding:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
    footer{padding:36px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    label{display:block;font-weight:600;margin:10px 0 6px}
    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6edf6;background:transparent}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
    .small{font-size:13px}
    .widget{margin-top:10px}
    .result{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#0f172a;color:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px}
    .row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .pill{background:#eef2ff;color:#0b1228;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600}
    .notice{background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #ffb020;padding:10px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:12px}
    .disclaimer{border-left:4px solid #ff6b6b;background:#fff1f1;padding:10px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:14px;color:#7a1124}
    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    .inline{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .seats{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}
    .seat-btn{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed #dbeafe;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}
    .packing{margin-top:10px}
    .copy{background:#e6eefc;color:#06336a;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:0;cursor:pointer}
    .kbd{font-family:monospace;background:#f3f4f6;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px}
    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.wrap{padding:12px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px">
      <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef2ff,#fff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)">SB</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="events.html">Calendar</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private Offerings</a>
      <a href="pricing.html"><strong>Join</strong></a>
      <a href="about.html">The Approach</a>
      <a href="contact.html" style="color:var(--accent)">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="hero">
      <section class="panel">
        <div class="pattern" aria-hidden>
          <!-- decorative SVG pattern; also references assets/img/pattern.svg for other pages -->
          <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 600 160" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#eef2ff" />
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#f6fbff" />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <rect width="600" height="160" fill="url(#g)" />
            <g fill="none" stroke="#dfe8ff" stroke-opacity="0.8">
              <path d="M0 40 Q120 10 240 40 T480 40 T600 40"/>
              <path d="M0 80 Q120 110 240 80 T480 80 T600 80" stroke-opacity="0.5"/>
              <circle cx="520" cy="30" r="18" fill="#e9efff" stroke="none" />
              <circle cx="480" cy="120" r="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="none" />
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h1>Let's find the next steadying pause</h1>
        <p class="lead">Reach out for questions, bookings, or to plan a recurring practice. Use the live tools to draft your session and preview what to bring.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:14px">
          <div class="row small">
            <div class="pill">Phone</div>
            <div class="muted">{{PHONE}}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row small" style="margin-top:6px">
            <div class="pill">Email</div>
            <div class="muted">{{EMAIL}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="notice">
          <strong>Contraindications</strong>
          <div class="muted">If you have epilepsy, recent head injuries, implanted medical devices, are pregnant, or have other acute medical concerns, consult your care provider before attending. Contact us with any health questions prior to booking.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a href="book.html" class="pill" style="text-decoration:none">Reserve a Spot</a>
          <a href="events.html" class="pill" style="text-decoration:none">See Upcoming Sessions</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="panel">
        <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">Interactive Session Planner</h2>
        <div class="muted small">Build a short plan and copy a plaintext summary to include in your booking note.</div>

        <div class="widget">
          <label for="goal">Primary intention</label>
          <select id="goal">
            <option value="calm">Ease into sleep</option>
            <option value="focus">Regulate attention</option>
            <option value="recharge">Reset midday energy</option>
            <option value="ritual">Transition ritual (before/from events)</option>
          </select>

          <div class="cols" style="margin-top:8px">
            <div>
              <label for="length">Session length</label>
              <select id="length">
                <option value="30">30 minutes</option>
                <option value="45">45 minutes</option>
                <option value="60" selected>60 minutes</option>
                <option value="90">90 minutes</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="frequency">Recommended frequency</label>
              <select id="frequency">
                <option value="single">One-off</option>
                <option value="weekly">Weekly</option>
                <option value="biweekly">Every other week</option>
                <option value="monthly">Monthly</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <label style="margin-top:8px">Instrument palette</label>
          <div class="row">
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="gongs" /> Gongs</label>
            <label style="margin-left:8px"><input type="checkbox" id="bowls" checked /> Singing bowls</label>
            <label style="margin-left:8px"><input type="checkbox" id="voice" /> Voice</label>
          </div>

          <label style="margin-top:8px">Notes for the facilitator (optional)</label>
          <textarea id="notes" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. prefer low frequencies, light touch on transitions"></textarea>

          <div class="cta-row">
            <button id="buildPlan">Compose summary</button>
            <button id="copyPlan" class="copy" title="Copy to clipboard">Copy</button>
            <div class="muted" id="planStatus">Ready</div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <div class="muted small">Plan preview</div>
            <div id="planResult" class="result">No plan composed yet.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Seat selector & packing list</h3>
        <p class="muted small">Select an upcoming gathering to reserve seats (simulated). The packing list adapts to the event style and your choices.</p>

        <label for="eventSelect">Upcoming sessions</label>
        <select id="eventSelect">
          <option data-cap="18" data-type="evening" value="2026-03-01">March 1 — Twilight Gather — 7:00 PM</option>
          <option data-cap="24" data-type="morning" value="2026-03-03">March 3 — Morning Drift — 9:30 AM</option>
          <option data-cap="12" data-type="outdoor" value="2026-03-07">March 7 — Park Sound Walk — 6:00 PM</option>
        </select>

        <div class="seats">
          <label for="seatCount">Seats</label>
          <button class="seat-btn" id="dec">−</button>
          <input id="seatCount" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="6" style="width:56px;text-align:center" />
          <button class="seat-btn" id="inc">+</button>
          <div class="muted" id="remaining">Available: —</div>
        </div>

        <div class="packing" id="packingArea">
          <div class="muted small">Packing list</div>
          <div id="packList" class="result">Select a session and choose seats to generate a list.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
          <button id="reserve">Reserve (simulate)</button>
          <div class="muted small">Will attach your plan and packing list to the booking note.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="disclaimer">
          <strong>Health & safety</strong>
          <div class="muted small">If you have respiratory issues or are currently ill, please defer attendance. For pregnancy or neurological conditions, consult your clinician before booking.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="panel">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Quick contact</h4>
        <div class="muted small">Prefer a direct message? Fill in the form and we'll reply within 48 hours.</div>
        <form id="contactForm" style="margin-top:10px">
          <label for="name">Name</label>
          <input id="name" placeholder="Your full name" />
          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input id="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" />
          <label for="msg">Message</label>
          <textarea id="msg" rows="3" placeholder="Short note so we can prepare"></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
            <button type="submit">Send</button>
            <button type="button" id="resetForm" style="background:#f3f4f6;color:#0f172a">Reset</button>
          </div>
          <div id="formStatus" class="muted small" style="margin-top:8px">We do not send emails from this demo.</div>
        </form>

        <div style="margin-top:18px">
          <strong style="display:block">Visit</strong>
          <div class="muted small">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <a href="pricing.html" class="pill" style="text-decoration:none">Membership & passes</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="muted">Questions? Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong>. Primary booking button: <span class="kbd">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</span></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Session Planner
    function buildPlanText(){
      const goal = document.getElementById('goal').value;
      const length = document.getElementById('length').value;
      const frequency = document.getElementById('frequency').value;
      const notes = document.getElementById('notes').value.trim();
      const instruments = [];
      if(document.getElementById('gongs').checked) instruments.push('gongs');
      if(document.getElementById('bowls').checked) instruments.push('singing bowls');
      if(document.getElementById('voice').checked) instruments.push('voice');

      const map = {
        calm: 'Wind-down + ease toward sleep',
        focus: 'Attention regulation and gentle grounding',
        recharge: 'Short reset to refresh the nervous system',
        ritual: 'Transitional sound ceremony'
      };

      let text = `Session Plan — ${map[goal] || goal}\n`;
      text += `Length: ${length} minutes\n`;
      text += `Suggested cadence: ${frequency}\n`;
      text += `Instrument palette: ${instruments.length ? instruments.join(', ') : 'facilitator choice'}\n`;
      if(notes) text += `Notes: ${notes}\n`;
      text += `Prepared for booking submission.`;
      return text;
    }

    document.getElementById('buildPlan').addEventListener('click',function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const txt = buildPlanText();
      document.getElementById('planResult').textContent = txt;
      document.getElementById('planStatus').textContent = 'Composed';
    });

    document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click',function(){
      const txt = document.getElementById('planResult').textContent;
      if(!txt || txt === 'No plan composed yet.') return;
      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(()=>{
        document.getElementById('planStatus').textContent = 'Copied to clipboard';
      }).catch(()=>{ document.getElementById('planStatus').textContent = 'Copy failed'; });
    });

    // Seat selector + packing list
    const eventSelect = document.getElementById('eventSelect');
    const seatCount = document.getElementById('seatCount');
    const remaining = document.getElementById('remaining');
    const packList = document.getElementById('packList');
    const inc = document.getElementById('inc');
    const dec = document.getElementById('dec');
    const reserveBtn = document.getElementById('reserve');

    // Fake available seats state
    const avail = {};
    Array.from(eventSelect.options).forEach(opt=>{ avail[opt.value]=parseInt(opt.dataset.cap,10); });

    function updateRemaining(){
      const opt = eventSelect.selectedOptions[0];
      const cap = parseInt(opt.dataset.cap,10);
      remaining.textContent = `Available: ${cap}`;
    }

    function generatePacking(){
      const opt = eventSelect.selectedOptions[0];
      const type = opt.dataset.type; // morning, evening, outdoor
      const count = parseInt(seatCount.value,10) || 1;
      let items = ["mat or yoga pad","water bottle","small cushion","warm blanket"];
      if(type === 'morning') items = ["mat or pad","light blanket","water","sunglasses or hat"];
      if(type === 'evening') items = ["mat","warmer blanket","eye mask","water (optional)"];
      if(type === 'outdoor') items = ["water bottle","warm layer","closed-toe shoes","insect repellent","mat"];
      if(count>3) items.push("arrive early for group set-up")

      const text = `Event: ${opt.text}\nSeats requested: ${count}\nPacking list:\n- ${items.join('\n- ')}\nNotes: Check weather for outdoor sessions.`;
      packList.textContent = text;
    }

    eventSelect.addEventListener('change',function(){
      updateRemaining();
      generatePacking();
    });

    inc.addEventListener('click',function(){
      let v = parseInt(seatCount.value,10)||1; v = Math.min(6,v+1); seatCount.value = v; generatePacking();
    });
    dec.addEventListener('click',function(){
      let v = parseInt(seatCount.value,10)||1; v = Math.max(1,v-1); seatCount.value = v; generatePacking();
    });
    seatCount.addEventListener('input',generatePacking);

    reserveBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
      const opt = eventSelect.selectedOptions[0];
      const key = opt.value;
      const requested = parseInt(seatCount.value,10)||1;
      if(requested>avail[key]){
        alert('Not enough seats available for this demo. Please reduce count.');
        return;
      }
      avail[key] -= requested;
      updateRemaining();
      alert('Reservation simulated. Your plan and packing list will be added to the booking note.');
    });

    // Contact form (no network)
    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit',function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const n=document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const em=document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const m=document.getElementById('msg').value.trim();
      if(!n||!em||!m){ document.getElementById('formStatus').textContent='Please complete the form.'; return; }
      document.getElementById('formStatus').textContent='Message prepared locally (demo) — double-check details before sending.';
    });
    document.getElementById('resetForm').addEventListener('click',function(){ document.getElementById('name').value='';document.getElementById('email').value='';document.getElementById('msg').value='';document.getElementById('formStatus').textContent='Form reset.'});

    // Initialize
    updateRemaining();
    generatePacking();

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the sound bath site (chunk 4)

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html — interactive contact & planning page

Purpose
- A calm, clinical-toned contact page that includes two small local interactive tools:
  1) Session Planner — compose a plaintext plan summarizing the intended session. The plan can be copied to clipboard and pasted into booking notes.
  2) Seat Selector + Packing List — choose a simulated upcoming session, pick seat quantity, and produce a tailored "what to bring" list. A reserve button simulates seat reduction.

Placeholders used (replace with real values during integration):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes on behavior
- No external network requests are made.
- The contact form is a demo-only, local handler that shows status messages but does not submit data.
- The seat selector uses a local in-memory availability map; the "Reserve (simulate)" button decreases the local available count.
- The Session Planner builds a short plaintext summary based on the selected options and notes. Use the "Compose summary" button then "Copy" to send the text into any booking form.

Accessibility & safety
- Contraindications and health advisories are included directly on the page. Ensure these remain visible and up-to-date according to local policies.

Integration tips
- Link this page from the site navigation: contact.html
- The decorative pattern is inline in this file for the contact view. Other pages reference assets/img/pattern.svg; provide a unique SVG at that path for consistent branding across the template.

Local testing
- Open contact.html in a modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Edge, Safari).
- Test planner: choose options, click "Compose summary", then "Copy" and paste into a text editor.
- Test seats: select different sessions, change seat count, click "Reserve (simulate)" and observe the available count change.

Developer notes
- Keep the contraindications copy visible and do not remove it.
- The UI uses vanilla JS and no build step; you can extract the small scripts if you prefer module structure.

Design decisions
- Clinical-calm voice and restrained color palette to support a membership-oriented offering.
- The session planner emphasizes plaintext export to simplify inclusion in booking flows or email messages.

If you need additional pages or the SVG asset created, request the next chunk which includes assets and other pages."}
